fcntl This module performs file control and I/O control on file built-in
fcntl ($module, fd, cmd, arg=0, /) fcntl Perform the operation cmd on file descriptor fd.
ioctl ($module, fd, request, arg=0, mutate_flag=True, /) fcntl Perform the operation request on file descriptor fd.
flock ($module, fd, operation, /) fcntl Perform the lock operation on file descriptor fd.
lockf ($module, fd, cmd, len=0, start=0, whence=0, /) fcntl A wrapper around the fcntl() locking calls.
